        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I rarely write reviews, but I'm absolutely delighted to give one for Jessy Panneton and his team!\nThe work they did was exceptional, and we are completely satisfied and thrilled with the results!\nJessy is friendly and professional, clearly loves his job, and it shows in the results!\nA huge thank you to you, Jessy! 🤗",
        "time": 1749582374,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cyn",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101019168475648253270/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLn5WggHh59wVBGgXlBWijiWjl2ufHYrvvtZeuOOmJMpM0cZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Very nice work, I had a hollow core slab entrance and a concrete slab made for my shed. The guys are friendly and the work is well done efficiently! I recommend Jessy Panneton to anyone who has excavation work to do.",
        "time": 1751855291,
        "translated": true
      },
